    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/3b31ea974006da55a19ff2a420dfe75f.webp?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=39 /></span>In the game &quot;Domovoy&quot; you will have to dive into a seemingly ordinary apartment, but the further you go, the more HE reveals his essence. This horror game is a first-person walking simulator with a tense atmosphere, explore the apartment, find answers and move on. Are you ready to meet HIM?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/b2aa998278e05fd0a92407ba21e72c27.poster.avif?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/b2aa998278e05fd0a92407ba21e72c27.webm?t=1747593228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/b2aa998278e05fd0a92407ba21e72c27.mp4?t=1747593228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/50f3f656475cbc54518911f0179e1238.webp?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domovoy is not only a guardian of the hearth, but also a vengeful spirit. If ignored or disrespected, it can turn against the owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/76bd832976b06d7caa15f3d308c030a4.poster.avif?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/76bd832976b06d7caa15f3d308c030a4.webm?t=1747593228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/76bd832976b06d7caa15f3d308c030a4.mp4?t=1747593228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/1c7de0b26f326dbee5ef80c70c6c9ad7.webp?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of the USSR of the late 80s</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking simulator</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slavic mythology</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/3b31ea974006da55a19ff2a420dfe75f.webp?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=39 /></span>In the game &quot;Domovoy&quot; you will have to dive into a seemingly ordinary apartment, but the further you go, the more HE reveals his essence. This horror game is a first-person walking simulator with a tense atmosphere, explore the apartment, find answers and move on. Are you ready to meet HIM?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/b2aa998278e05fd0a92407ba21e72c27.poster.avif?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/b2aa998278e05fd0a92407ba21e72c27.webm?t=1747593228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/b2aa998278e05fd0a92407ba21e72c27.mp4?t=1747593228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/50f3f656475cbc54518911f0179e1238.webp?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domovoy is not only a guardian of the hearth, but also a vengeful spirit. If ignored or disrespected, it can turn against the owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095160/extras/76bd832976b06d7caa15f3d308c030a4.poster.avif?t=1747593228\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.